WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The table is alive, but the tools are fighting the table.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
NEXUS-PAN keeps shared state steady across devices.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
ALICE explains build tradeoffs before they break play.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
KARMA FORGE makes house rules governed and reversible.

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.000
JACKPOINT turns table memory into sharp briefings.

6
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:46.000
RUNSITE makes mission spaces legible before danger starts.

7
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:54.000
RUNBOOK PRESS turns campaign material into books.

8
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:02.000
TABLE PULSE turns heat into bounded GM-approved reactions.

9
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:12.000
BLACK LEDGER makes the city remember consequences.

10
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:20.000
COMMUNITY HUB helps players find runs and close the loop.

11
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:30.000
All Horizons return to one table and one campaign.
